        "body": "PDF extraction can interleave columns and preserve long whitespace runs that model-generated quotations omit. Before inserting extracted cells into accumulated rows, require nonempty values, evidence and source lists, and verify each quote occurs exactly in every cited fetched source. Stage updates until validation completes; keep failed cells pending. Report failures with the entity, field, source URL and failed condition rather than a bare assertion, so one mismatching citation can be diagnosed without repeating extraction. Repair by locating and slicing the original source text, preserving intervening text and whitespace, or use another fetched source. Remove a mismatching citation only when the remaining citation independently supports the complete value. Recheck membership and semantic support after repair; substring membership alone does not establish semantic support. A proposed repair is not a verified repair.",
