        "title": "Reconcile duplicate entity records before updating cells",
        "body": "Extraction batches may return multiple valid records for the same entity and field. Sequential assignment silently makes the last record win, potentially discarding supported citizenships or other multivalued facts. Group records by entity key and field before mutation, detect duplicates, and reconcile their evidence. Preserve supported complementary facts, distinguish citizenship from regional identity or ancestry, and investigate conflicting claims. Ensure the final cell's citation supports its complete value under the output contract; never concatenate unrelated quotations and present them as one contiguous source span.",
